                    <lb n="10"/><placeName><expan><abbr>Aquil</abbr><ex>eiam</ex></expan></placeName>
                    <lb n="11"/>perlatum
                    <lb n="12"/>libens posuit
                    <lb n="13"/><expan><abbr>L</abbr><ex>ocus</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>atus</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>ecreto</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>ecurionum</ex></expan>
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <listApp>
                    <app><note>Text from EDR</note></app>
                </listApp>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>Sacred to Belenus Augustus. Lucius Cornelius Secundinus, son of Lucius, of tribe Vellina, (of) Aquileia, the evocatus of our Augustus, he willingly set [this] up at Aquileia, that which he had devoted in the city. This place was given by decree of the decurions.</p>
            </div>
